      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHASING KISSES (8) is yet to be beaten at the course and distance, scoring four wins from as many starts. Scored by 7 lengths last time (17.00) in a Grade 5 over 300m at this track. With a clean break looks hard to beat. GOOD ODDS CUBA (2) comes off an average run last start when seventh at The Gardens over 400m behind Rhapsody Beast (23.82) in a Grade 5. Was a winner the start prior. In the mix. TULLOCH ROAD (1) pinged the lids and was in the firing line early but drifted out of it when 6th at this track in Grade 4 company. Can do much better this time. HOLLIES HAYLEY (7) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
